Package: transformers-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python, python-pip, python-numpy, python-torch, python-tokenizers, rust, clang, make, pkg-config, libyaml
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: Hugging Face Transformers for Termux - small language models
 apt installs PyTorch, NumPy, Tokenizers (tur-repo) and Rust; the
 install step pip-installs transformers, safetensors, huggingface_hub,
 regex and pyyaml (safetensors compiles with Rust, ~5-15 min).
 Commands: transformers-setup, transformers-check, tiny-llm "prompt".
